.env

# Deploy build byproduct (see .github/workflows/deploy.yml)
build/

# The TWA/Play build (docs/publish_todo.md B0). Only the config is versioned: the Android
# project around it is generated from that file by `make android CMD=update`, so committing
# it would be committing a build artefact. An allowlist rather than a list of things to skip,
# because the one file that must never be committed — android.keystore, which is the identity
# of the app on Play — would otherwise be one forgotten line away from being included.
twa/*
!twa/twa-manifest.json

docker/volumes/postgres_data/**
docker/volumes/php_home/**
docker/volumes/node_home/**
!docker/volumes/**/.gitkeep
